  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Long hours of meditation and focus upon your shaping of veils has allowed you to reduce their effects against trusted allies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Veilweaver level 7th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you shape your veils for the day, you may select a number of allies equal to your veilweaving modifier. These creatures take no damage from veils you have shaped, and if they must roll a saving throw against a veil you have shaped they are always treated as if they passed the saving throw when determining its effects.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc44\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
